WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.240
Un mensaje del asistente de Walt.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.760
What does it say?

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.960
Mr. Henderson invites you

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.240
and your husband to his apartment

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.160
at 12 o'clock for an important

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.400
announcement regarding...

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:22.880
a wedding.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:24.960
If that's the case,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.200
I can cancel my plans.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.320
It's weird that

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:28.960
Walt didn't send

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:29.840
this personally.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.000
Why have the assistant do it?

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:33.880
I don't know.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:34.800
Let's find out.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.440
I'll be there.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.360
Perfect.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.480
Why are you shaking?

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.200
We've crossed every line.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.160
There's no turning back.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.760
I'll make sure we have

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.440
a wealthy retirement.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.440
Now

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.160
send a message to Walt.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.920
It's showtime.
